e spawn rate of encounters since some players were not seeing as many as they'd like. The game is still typically a chill driving experience, but hopefully the higher spawn rate ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T23:44:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675894","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4313250-1835871199306065","game_id":"steam-4313250","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.3.1","summary":"Fixed a bug making new songs slow to load on first play.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T03:51:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199306065","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4313250-1835871199306037","game_id":"steam-4313250","kind":"announcement","title":"0.3.0 Improvements from Feedback","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the demo, and those who left valuable feedback. I'll be continuing to work on improvements over time, but for now I've made a few quick changes based on player's reported experiences. Also thank you JGL for contributing 5 more tracks to the games radio! 5 new tracks from talented indie artist JGL (3 synth, 1 jazz/funk, 1 ambience). Fuel now drains slower when fuel is very low. (0.5x drain speed at","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T03:31:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199306037","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4313250-1835871199302995","game_id":"steam-4313250","kind":"update","title":"NEW STUFF UPDATE!","summary":"Hi guys! Thank you so much for your continued support during the development of BURNTCRUST! I've been listening to feedback, and have made a few tweaks and additions to hopefully improve the demo for Next Fest. UpdatesMore events! There are around 5-10 new encounters and locations that can spawn.I've further increased the spawn rate of encounters since some players were not seeing as many as they'd like. The game is still typically a chill driving experience, but hopefully the higher spawn rate ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T06:07:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199302995","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4313250-1835236783572924","game_id":"steam-4313250","kind":"announcement","title":"BURNTCRUST Demo Launch","summary":"The time has come! The demo for BURNTCRUST is now live! Will be keeping an eye on any issues and bugs, as this is my first attempt at a live access product. Feel free to join the discord to report anything or give feedback. Hope to see you in space soon!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T03:50:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783572924","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4313250-1832700592791624","game_id":"steam-4313250","kind":"announcement","title":"Attention Playtesters!","summary":"BURNTCRUST's first playtest is almost ready! Make sure to request access on the store page if you haven't yet, and join the discord to get more info about the starting time, as well as the game's overall progress. This early playtest will be for testing bugs, general gameplay feel and direction, and to understand the player expectations as well as any major mistakes to avoid / fix before the final release. Feedback-wise, I've been working on a simple survey so players can give their feedback to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-15T11:30:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592791624","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4313250-1832065502810724","game_id":"steam-4313250","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.0.2","summary":"Looking for Playtesters!Currently looking for playtesters to give early access to. Feel free to join the discord if you're interested: https://discord.gg/7cVWKsZtu OptimisationLOD levels added properly to all major locations. This should improve performance when a large number of locations are spawned at the same time.Limited max number of job delivery locations active at a time (currently set to 5). Oldest one is deleted when a new one spawns, similar to the other system added for other locatio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-07T02:43:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502810724","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4313250-1831432155579297","game_id":"steam-4313250","kind":"update","title":"Patch 0.0.1","summary":"OptimisationThere are now a maximum number of regions, points of interest, and levels that can be spawned at a time (4 regions, 7 points of interest, 12 mid-job levels). When a new one is spawned, the oldest is deleted for each category.Simplified segmented enemy logic, improving performance, and made them inactive if not in aggro range.Simplified hiearchy for a few locations.Casino rewards now spawn faster (from a incremental gap of 3 to 2).Lowered default graphics settings (a bunch of settings","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-05T07:11:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155579297","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4313250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:29Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:29Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4313250":"2026-10-26T02:10:29Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4313250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4833880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:10:29Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4313250","app_id":4313250,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"0202126c916c045cd8ab68a58e489163b91bcb24370f8cee77d605a9930a8665","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Drive across randomly generated galaxies, deliver pizza, upgrade your ship, and plan your route to avoid hostiles. Or get drunk, gamble away your life savings, and crash full speed into an asteroid field. I won't judge.","publishers":[{"name":"hitstop","creator_clan_account_id":45962846}],"developers":[{"name":"hitstop","creator_clan_account_id":45962846}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Reveal Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1770435800","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4313250/549570987/f20c7a84897c84210881b13741398165